/target
**/*.rs.bk

# Fixture packages are analyzed with `cargo metadata --no-deps`, never built by
# the test suite — but they are written as code that compiles, so anyone
# checking that with `cargo check` leaves a `target/` and a lock file behind.
# Neither is input to anything, and both churn with the toolchain.
tests/fixtures/**/target/
tests/fixtures/**/Cargo.lock

# Scratch report the code-review skill writes at the repository root while a
# slice is under review. Input to that loop only, never to the build.
agent-code-review.md
